=== taxonomy
projects projects/media-analysis On-device media analysis :: What Frame Job works out about a file on this Mac (voice, shots, faces, people, masks, sound events, loudness, filmstrips and waveforms), how it runs in the background one job at a time, the Analyzing
effects effects/remove-background Remove Background :: Cutting a person or foreground out with on-device masks on video and pictures: Subject, Background Remove or Keep, Edge, Feather, Status and Analyze Now, automatic cached masks, and exports waiting fo
audio audio/synchronize-audio Synchronize Audio :: Clip ▸ Synchronize Audio: lining clips up by their sound, the anchor rule, the head trim, drift correction, the Synchronizing Audio sheet, moves on whole frames, and refusals.
audio audio/weak-sync-matches Confident and weak matches :: How Synchronize Audio grades a match, the Weak match sheet and what accepting does, and no-match refusals.
framing framing/show-subjects Show Subjects :: View ▸ Show Subjects: the overlay's face, people and salient outlines, the Not analyzed note, following a clip's placement and timing, and that it is per window.
multicam multicam/set-up Set up several cameras :: One camera per track, lined up in time with Synchronize Audio, track names as camera names, and the microphones beside them.
multicam multicam/one-microphone Cut from faces with one microphone :: Faces mode for a show with one microphone: the sheet's layout and warning, the Analyzing sheet for faces, and Wide in this mode.
mcp mcp/tools-analysis Tools: reading analysis :: get_media_analysis and its kinds (shots, faces, subjects, sound events, person masks) over a clip or a whole file, and analyze_cutout.
