3	/// Switch by Speaker's faces mode (road map "creator-jobs" SW8, spec §11 SW-80…SW-86): one
4	/// microphone shared by two or more angles, who talks decided by each angle's mouth activity
5	/// (`FaceActivity`) while the microphone hears speech, and SW-22's `shots` run unchanged over
6	/// those labels with the face pairing.
7	///
